# Docker build context excludes.
#
# The regression Dockerfiles do `COPY packages/ ./packages/` and install/build
# inside the image, so anything here is either rebuilt in-image or actively
# harmful to copy in.

# Installed dependencies. pnpm links packages/*/node_modules into the root
# .pnpm store; copying those symlinks into the image yields dangling links, and
# every Dockerfile runs `pnpm install` itself anyway.
node_modules
**/node_modules

# Build output — every image builds from source.
**/dist

# Local CodeGen artifacts (gitignored). These are regenerated per-environment:
# Dockerfile.api overlays them from docker/regression/.docker-generated/, but
# Dockerfile.db-setup does not, so a developer's stale copy leaks in and fails
# the build against the checked-in GeneratedEntities (TS2305 on AssociationDemo*).
packages/MJAPI/src/generated/class-registrations-manifest.ts

# VCS + editor noise
.git
.vscode
